	measure 'Risk Intensity Color' = ```
			
			        VAR p = [Priority %]
			        RETURN
			            SWITCH (
			                TRUE (),
			                ISBLANK ( p ), BLANK (),
			                p >= 0.45, "#FECACA",
			                p >= 0.25, "#FEF08A",
			                "#DCFCE7"
			            )
			```
		lineageTag: 6a9c3f7b-4d0e-46c5-f2a8-7b3d6e5f4c06

